    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13127ceeb53ad9ce1b69a7f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "富士奇石决定将在\n十一月的“日本杯”重新复出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8421e2b5f9d3911083ee0d76da24344681176cd39092504ad9ab373697a0f1bd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea47447acdbb1e02de008809",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“活着与奔跑都是如此快乐”──\n美丽周日埋下的意念\n牵引着富士奇石再度回到舞台上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4e800df33d5ed231a34b54538b8e98dabbf22486931b8cd73a92943ee54056d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b07a6bfccaa6011b38afa74",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽、富士奇石，再加上美丽周日，\n今天这场比赛\n无疑将成为一场极致演出。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a8be4b14d616a486601932bfa3a6b2357cc3d338d9f46173bc1198281ea709e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc765bbecb129a625cb5e33f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们将在这盛大舞台上展现出\n更巨大、更广阔的美丽──\n“日本杯”此刻即将开赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d458febe15b337ca142c2de91ef911ccc7cceed8db9d563a32b97c8895ecef4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:354ad10928106dc7988afb86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向日本C",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e1f84315d13bd4d7813896c86fba6375f2ea4423c867825e53360377150302",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055416.json",
