    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eecb1709f33cdfb078ad8af",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "华丽明星阵容齐聚一堂的\n“有马纪念”当天。中山赛场被\n可谓狂热般的兴奋与期待包围。",
      "source_fingerprint": "649ac755a6fb3e83de27aaea0834eb4eb3d308fd2dd03a47e82df33387f46c47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98cfcf2737c4f67f74ac75fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f13d2213cdae00e36a9872e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相信美丽周日眼中已经看见了\n今日将从此地扩散出去的美丽。\n让她在“有马纪念”尽情缔造成绩吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "285c649d132cc1b7314cd7bcd1690481f82229185836be28ce9e711b066204c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f18e336588c8d632649c802",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa34f4c763e7c06e7b321c01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此外，其他参赛者们\n胸中也同样充满兴奋与期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3c63d6ef888c18d412968410e3b2fdd9b319c5996f706948305cab5f9719c2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a0dc0ff11f03930020aff1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:764215dee8ec9746a7ae4ec7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们从美丽周日身上收下美丽，\n各自将美丽孕育成长后\n再以其光辉照亮美丽周日。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51cd0a4bc23490bf0c6eb009976cccc3d65e78e14f9a51839f81fd90e074f5a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4054cabeec3b2c0479ac36bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f720d11cbd184e1a49b39d1e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今日于此诞生的崭新美丽\n最终将扩散至何处呢──\n“有马纪念”终于即将开跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c84ecb1e37e1f4745630c9cb61bd847d5ad30cbb0ef46bcf0a5fc2b1aaa5207",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8041e4d9f60beee4d57ef89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向有马纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "a28480a57275928fde3ca335c4e37d5670b04bf8228df0e3cc61294de9b176ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:302472c70412eb5939af7a68",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑完出道战的美丽周日\n看起来依旧兴奋不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "84f2af5dd250c0f086359c93884bd795d4492977da1d12e49c107d71692acc2e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d915347b924a305c675c37e5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一同比赛的赛马娘们也深受她的影响，\n表现出正面积极的精神。\n眼前光景令美丽周日感到颇有斩获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "964838b312d6ac85cf2ee54000d12fdfe776f5586a87cc0153e0d3b4346d4f72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:068b2f7dd5c3ba76d18654b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而闪耀系列赛并非容易跨越的高墙。\n若想推广美丽就必须\n具有足以确实缔造果的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45a86ec903bb467663f6d0d70b10c354b03d416ef0a3731f590d07b8bccbff66",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a8e203be0b216bd638d4c0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为此，我们决定了眼下目标，\n先从累积参赛经验做起，\n借此稳健地增加粉丝。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e4618dee3d040530a79090f46c07888612ae67421e57bf448ccb87113ea0477",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28a6ebacdc37550886675090",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・刚开始的美丽",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a40ed1a60d85b1f9305d2d582f74630f8a1eaf0d42dbbbaf1fcdb8041297093",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9968f7f6e3f03d85ae038b04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日借由累积参赛经验，\n稳健地逐渐增加粉丝与实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d47a15a95e3dd465bae1d901d03487e03e5bdd5f59345f5aa213160992fcb80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a372be5d1435c5f82b1d070",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但这份喜悦并未持续太久，\n她的身体承受不了本身对赛跑的满满热情与\n自身资质，最终还是受伤了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c10fecf7a45038d49b78533cf0ba6621fa01dec7f5f442174241f4e23a032c6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50ee1777e34f0f2c5229366d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而美丽周日却不曾露出一丝沮丧。\n即便受伤，她都能从其中\n找出正面意义。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce63430557ced12733e880487a8eef1f4c823dc9a2f51cad42d25e7f1fededad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:422dbaf5cd115d8f90f81b77",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的乐观态度激励我重振精神，接下来\n我们打算着重于在古马级充分表现，\n并将下次目标订为“挑战杯”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d2905962f2653e981030207388428582da4bfe77714153f6dc248cb4119f15a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6845c790fd1cd0c2638d52de",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・一小步",
      "source_fingerprint": "d57373f0f06ede4203a1539b3d9129dffe50a80515e02c54b979c1c6e7469904",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
