    {
      "uid": "zhcn:262f8e52c338cc0663ff7593",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日跑完了“菊花赏”。\n仿佛与竞争对手灵魂碰撞的\n激烈比赛令她兴奋不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dff17407372000649736692d93c68c206c867ca631c2ae5977a7cd60bb15c84",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055420.json",
