    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19ccca525c645436c9a3ae1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使站上大舞台她仍然不改乐观本色，\n就连观众们都感受到了她的心情。\n想必下次的“挑战杯”也是胜券在握吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d82ee67e144d2493fe6bb05c9163364a11dabe88011b3f1798f120577ae72e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055420.json",
      "json_path": [
