      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错。一帆风顺、收获丰盛──\n直到此时我仍是这么深信……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f238d369c3eb0cc9096f8c05fa97d49c560ac5ed28036413915c6cc1e4ffbe64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
