    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5933e7b8035a21f4cf25aaba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她展现足以证明已彻底克服伤势的强悍表现\n跑完了“挑战杯”。此刻她似乎已经清楚看见\n即将到手的“美丽”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b02bf228f1209250a6c2d342a8d8f14d403da158b6010208f97b1b01e94f204",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
