    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32aa1982a78c630391257264",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "此时富士奇石也开口称赞她的表现。\n究竟还要花多久时间才能\n将“美丽”传递给富士奇石呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "74004395624c20bcd49ff5004cc34bf1ece412c8cde648af9f5d885d08346623",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055421.json",
