    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:891fc31d3302b95715b80920",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……首先是“大阪杯”。动力已经到手。\n古马级的时光就要展开，\n我们将在这一年改变一切。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cd55124d0fb34d2be5f3f7d30ce05911f37919f1c08015d513e1486f971a8b6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
