    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9424751c9972bd4f60352393",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "年底的中山赛场，大奖赛“有马纪念”。\n这场比赛强者云集，决战过程的激烈程度\n令观众与跑者都为之沸腾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9426b6c9c906e162c7af347695b6d71d9c6d86cda361f6cc40982d5f800b4769",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c14e4cb15ab95d5ba7346a62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96d584c684492e082979ad8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每位选手都发挥出\n累积至今的训练成果正面对决。\n似乎也对美丽周日造成良好刺激。",
      "source_fingerprint": "717745f8f4003b0d9784aac060297a24c98caaf386e422e2ab2d6ea8c254fad9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055422.json",
      "json_path": [
