    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e893e389cf22a2d1810f870",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・度过苦难的一年",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddfca8f846a18bbb6aa7fddc3229fceb0dc69e026c2d279d78f748deda02a96c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055422.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f46534006e3748ad190e73c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日展现了惊人优异的跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fa0dd9534ccb913f5944be87d98f27858663b85eeda343a7cae3e4c856223e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85b06b1bfd1e93268e9f737",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她用尽心力克服了反复发作的伤势，\n持续累积练习到这一天。\n最后──",
      "source_fingerprint": "57fec13a50ed1827421c6bc320c985fca2947c953b0635b55c1fd19c4658a1de",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e0464bbd04e1d20f01c01b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "漂亮地跑完“大阪杯”，\n并且精彩展现出\n不输竞争对手的美丽表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a38e35713f183f8f41f49b4188df642b44d7ffa26ebdb34a6f3345c92bdb6195",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d671841421bc339b7f0aeee8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着，她终于即将迈向\n“天皇赏（春）”了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd08e92069b0a9e9c81e94fbccd938da741e140d88f13276f90780647e7b3f46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70d6388c0f1944c36375dec8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "大阪杯结束后・下次就要大家一起──",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a73693e114c46934b483f9956b82089b884f21ef48fec9a308c33f964a8de47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19933f87c5d472e23a13a4f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "美丽周日漂亮地称霸了\n强者云集的“天皇赏（春）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af18d209e7019b7102f821394b01700dee542774fca6b410506647d06eb2d4c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1055/storytimeline_501055424.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:218f493035f5fd402388c4bb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的表现似乎也令竞争对手们\n得到丰盛的收获。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6a3a062cba7a4dff4e00411799a22959affa68b430bfbdb82b9119f21a892b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
